            "type": "name",
            "source": "🐱 Phycat theme Info & Help",
            "target": "🐱 Phycat theme Info & Help"
        },
        {
            "type": "markdown",
            "source": "true",
            "target": "true"
        },
        {
            "type": "description",
            "source": "### Phycat Theme \\n A vibrant, glassmorphism aesthetic theme for Obsidian. \\n\\n [Github Repository](https://github.com/sumruler/obsidian-theme-phycat) | [Report Issue](https://github.com/sumruler/obsidian-theme-phycat/issues)| [Support](https://www.phycat.cn/donate.html)",
            "target": "### Phycat Theme \\n A vibrant, glassmorphism aesthetic theme for Obsidian. \\n\\n [Github Repository](https://github.com/sumruler/obsidian-theme-phycat) | [Report Issue](https://github.com/sumruler/obsidian-theme-phycat/issues)| [Support](https://www.phycat.cn/donate.html)"
        },
        {
            "type": "description",
            "source": "**💡 Font Recommendation:** \\n This theme is optimized for [**LXGW WenKai**](https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai). Please install it for the best experience.",
            "target": "**💡 Font Recommendation:** \\n This theme is optimized for [**LXGW WenKai**](https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenKai). Please install it for the best experience."
        },
        {
            "type": "description",
            "source": "**🪟 Pro Tip: Independent Settings View** \\n Press `Ctrl+P` and search for `Style Settings: Show style settings view`. This opens the settings in a separate pane instead of a modal, preventing it from blocking your view.",
            "target": "**🪟 Pro Tip: Independent Settings View** \\n Press `Ctrl+P` and search for `Style Settings: Show style settings view`. This opens the settings in a separate pane instead of a modal, preventing it from blocking your view."
        },
        {
            "type": "description",
            "source": "**🧩 Plugin Recommendation: Hover Editor** \\n It is highly recommended to install the [**Hover Editor**](https://github.com/nothingislost/obsidian-hover-editor) plugin. You can turn the settings pane mentioned above into a floating window to tweak the theme in real-time.",
            "target": "**🧩 Plugin Recommendation: Hover Editor** \\n It is highly recommended to install the [**Hover Editor**](https://github.com/nothingislost/obsidian-hover-editor) plugin. You can turn the settings pane mentioned above into a floating window to tweak the theme in real-time."
        },
